extraction, chart reasoning, and chart-to-datatable transformations.\n\nAdditionally, the introduction of comprehensive evaluation benchmarks like MMC-Benchmark has facilitated a more thorough assessment of the models' capabilities. These benchmarks include a wide range of tasks that test the models' ability to perform complex reasoning, such as identifying data patterns, understanding context, and transforming visual information into structured formats.\n\nFinally, the use of neuro-symbolic models, which combine neural network-based perception with symbolic reasoning, has further enhanced the models' ability to perform logical reasoning. These models can disentangle visual perception, situation abstraction, and symbolic reasoning, providing a more robust framework for understanding and reasoning about charts.\n\nOverall, these advancements collectively address the challenges of visual and logical reasoning in charts by providing a more integrated, data-rich, and evaluation-driven approach to multimodal reasoning tasks.", "usageJudgementGeneratorLLM": ["2410.08202", "2203.10244", "2405.09711", "2311.10774"], "papersInputtedForGeneration": [{"ArXiv": "2410.08202", "category": "cs.CV", "cosineSimilarity": null}, {"ArXiv": "2203.10244", "category": "cs.CL", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8228807022083712}, {"ArXiv": "1511.02283", "category": "cs.CV", "cosineSimilarity": 0.880706720519104}, {"ArXiv": "2405.09711", "category": "cs.AI", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8223760813615392}, {"ArXiv": "2311.10774", "category": "cs.CL", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8956164131143124}], "anchorPaper": "2410.08202", "adaptiveCharacterLimit": 25000, "usageJudgeResult": [{"ArXiv": "2410.08202", "wasUsed": false}, {"ArXiv": "2203.10244", "wasUsed": false}, {"ArXiv": "1511.02283", "wasUsed": false}, {"ArXiv": "2405.09711", "wasUsed": false}, {"ArXiv": "2311.10774", "wasUsed": true}], "paperTextLengths": [{"ArXiv": "2410.08202", "textLength": 25050}, {"ArXiv": "2203.10244", "textLength": 25050}, {"ArXiv": "1511