vary significantly.\n\n5. **Model Comparison**: Comparing different limb darkening models (e.g., quadratic, nonlinear) and using the one that best fits the observed data can also help in reducing biases. The choice of model can be validated using goodness-of-fit statistics and cross-validation techniques.\n\nBy employing these methods, the precision of derived parameters in exoplanet transit studies can be significantly improved, leading to more accurate and reliable results.", "usageJudgementGeneratorLLM": ["1508.02634", "astro-ph/0210099", "1706.03084"], "papersInputtedForGeneration": [{"ArXiv": "1508.02634", "category": "astro-ph.EP", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8726611590162056}, {"ArXiv": "astro-ph/0210099", "category": "astro-ph", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8828844892346681}, {"ArXiv": "1706.03084", "category": "astro-ph.SR", "cosineSimilarity": null}, {"ArXiv": "1307.6212", "category": "astro-ph.IM", "cosineSimilarity": 0.877457325034705}, {"ArXiv": "1008.4312", "category": "astro-ph.SR", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8868125527108406}], "anchorPaper": "1706.03084", "adaptiveCharacterLimit": 26156, "usageJudgeResult": [{"ArXiv": "1508.02634", "wasUsed": true}, {"ArXiv": "astro-ph/0210099", "wasUsed": false}, {"ArXiv": "1706.03084", "wasUsed": false}, {"ArXiv": "1307.6212", "wasUsed": false}, {"ArXiv": "1008.4312", "wasUsed": false}], "paperTextLengths": [{"ArXiv": "1508.02634", "textLength": 22045}, {"ArXiv": "astro-ph/0210099", "textLength": 21319}, {"ArXiv": "1706.03084", "textLength": 28956}, {"ArXiv": "1307.6212", "textLength": 26620}, {"ArXiv": "1008.4312", "textLength": 26206}]}
