requires a combination of reinforcement learning, trial-and-error, and human-in-the-loop feedback. Designing effective frameworks for this is an ongoing challenge.\n\n5. **Real-Time Optimization**: Solving complex optimization problems in real-time, especially for tasks requiring high degrees of freedom (e.g., 6-12 DoF manipulations), is computationally intensive. Efficient algorithms and hardware acceleration are necessary.\n\n6. **Generalization and Robustness**: Ensuring that models generalize well to new tasks and environments without overfitting to training data is crucial. This requires robust evaluation metrics and diverse testing scenarios.\n\n7. **Safety and Ethical Considerations**: Ensuring that agents behave safely and ethically in real-world environments is paramount. This involves designing systems that can detect and mitigate potential risks and biases.\n\nBy addressing these challenges, researchers can develop more capable and reliable language model agents that can perform a wide range of complex tasks in real-world settings.", "usageJudgementGeneratorLLM": ["2412.13549", "2311.12871", "2409.01652"], "papersInputtedForGeneration": [{"ArXiv": "2010.01717", "category": "cs.CL", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8974718393768163}, {"ArXiv": "2412.13549", "category": "cs.CL", "cosineSimilarity": null}, {"ArXiv": "2403.04652", "category": "cs.CL", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8780811448286121}, {"ArXiv": "2311.12871", "category": "cs.CV", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8929581074594591}, {"ArXiv": "2409.01652", "category": "cs.RO", "cosineSimilarity": 0.8774627822013746}], "anchorPaper": "2412.13549", "adaptiveCharacterLimit": 31418, "usageJudgeResult": [{"ArXiv": "2010.01717", "wasUsed": false}, {"ArXiv": "2412.13549", "wasUsed": null}, {"ArXiv": "2403.04652", "wasUsed": true}, {"ArXiv": "2311.12871", "wasUsed": true}, {"ArXiv": "2409.01652", "wasUsed": false}], "paperTextLengths": [{"ArXiv": "2010.01717", "textLength": 1645}, {"ArXiv": "2412.13549", "textLength": 30882}, {"ArXiv"